Sorry, no manual page for this one.

Choos is based on the old "pic" program (renamed to avoid conflict with the
DWB graphics typesetting program) by Tom Duff.  The selection of arguments
is stored in an array, allowing the user to back up and/or wrap around the
argument list.  Choos without arguments elicits a help message.  Enjoy.

